sm) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drakimoto" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5255688&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="DrAkimoto" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5255688)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drakimoto" >DrAkimoto</a></span></li> <li><em>SCP-4677-1 is a 100-page document detailing the Coca-Cola original formula and the four rituals required to produce it.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>9 December 2019 - selected by <em>cybersqyd</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/adoption-poster-darius">Adoption Poster: Darius!</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3487700&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="Uncle Nicolini" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3487700)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" >Uncle Nicolini</a></span></li> <li><em>I can get pretty loud if someone I don't like comes near, so be careful!</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>17 December 2019 - selected by <em>RockTeethMothEyes</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/weissman-model-assistance-clones">'Weissman Model Assistance Clones' (ET796/IH249/W3336)</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/othellothecat" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3213383&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="OthellotheCat" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3213383)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/othellothecat" >OthellotheCat</a></span></li> <li><em>Be in the best hands in your twilight years.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>25 December 2019 - selected by <em>Simartar<