known as a Cavendish banana.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>25 January 2020 - selected by <em>Cerastes</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/sometimes-it-s-not-funny">Sometimes It's Not Funny</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kinchtheknifeblade" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1345012&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="kinchtheknifeblade" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1345012)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kinchtheknifeblade" >kinchtheknifeblade</a></span></li> <li><em>jockjamsvol6: Guys, I got some bad news.</em></li> </ul> <h4><span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">February 2020:</span></span></h4> <p><strong>1 February 2020 - selected by <em>cybersqyd</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/ambrose-backdoor-soho">Ambrose Backdoor Soho</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uraniumempire" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1613974&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="UraniumEmpire" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1613974)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uraniumempire" >UraniumEmpire</a></span></li> <li><em>Ambrose is proud to present Ambrose BackDoor SoHo, a unique blend of contemporary art and fine dining experiences.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>9 February 2020 - selected by <em>MalyceGraves</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4372">SCP-4372</a> (So Very Small, So Very Safe) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/francis-scalia" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=209952&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="Francis Scalia" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=209952)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/francis-scalia" >Francis Scalia</a></span></li> <li><em>Due to these compression effects, the internal topography of SCP-4372 appears vastly larger than its outer dimensions.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>17 February 2020 - selected by <em>F15H35</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4438">SCP-4438</a> (FOURTH) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tanhony" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=776854&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="Tanhony" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=776854)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tanhony" >Tanhony</a></span></li> <li><em>SCP-4438 is a rare phenomena which is known to occur when an individual is making a choice between three similar objects or entities.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>25 February 2020 - selected by <em>gee0765</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4357">SCP-4357</a> (Slimelord) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/literallymechanical" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2829014&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="LiterallyMechanical" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2829014)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/literallymechanical" >LiterallyMechanical</a></span></li> <li><em>SCP-4357-0-A: OH MY GOD, RUDY, LEARN TO READ SARCASM. I WAS JUST MOCKING YOU.</em></li> </ul> <h4><span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">March 2020:</span></span></h4> <p><strong>1 March 2020 - selected by <em>N_Aepic_Fael</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5621">SCP-5621</a> (Jealousy, Murder, and Alchemy) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drmagnus" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=318209&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="DrMagnus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=318209)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drmagnus" >DrMagnus</a></span></li> <li><em>Due to the immobile nature of SCP-5621, the pool complex at Calvin University is marked as closed at this time.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>9 March 2020 - selected by <em>RockTeethMothEyes</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4236">SCP-4236</a> (It's the End of the World (And Everyone Feels Fine)) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/legotrekker" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5505138&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="Legotrekker" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5505138)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/legotrekker" >Legotrekker</a></span></li> <li><em>&quot;It doesn't really matter anymore anyway. The hype is gone, the movement is over.&quot;</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>17 March 2020 - selected by <em>DrUnoriginal</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4192">SCP-4192</a> (As Above) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/connor-macwarren" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3741977&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="Connor MacWarren" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3741977)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/connor-macwarren" >Connor MacWarren</a></span></li> <li><em>SCP-4192 refers to the nucleus of a single Hydrogen atom that emits radio waves at random intervals.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>25 March 2020 - selected by <em>HammerMaiden</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4197">SCP-4197</a> (Hollow) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dyslexion" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5549954&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="Dyslexion" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5549954)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dyslexion" >Dyslexion</a></span></li> <li><em>SCP-4197 is a thirty-two-year-old adult humanoid female named Doctor Sarah Veers, an acclaimed surgeon and known practitioner of cytomancy.</em></li> </ul> <h4><span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">April 2020:</span></span></h4> <p><strong>1 April 2020 - selected by <em>Zoobeeny</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5908">SCP-5908</a> (Missing Bullets) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drakimoto" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5255688&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="DrAkimoto" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5255688)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drakimoto" >DrAkimoto</a></span></li> <li><em>SCP-5908 was designed with thaumaturgic runes along the barrel capable of triggering a ritual upon firing of the weapon.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>9 April 2020 - selected by <em>barredowl</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4529">SCP-4529</a> (A Walk in the Park) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/barredowl" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6001754&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="barredowl" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6001754)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/barredowl" >barredowl</a></span></li> <li><em>SCP-4529 is a forest neighboring the playground of Herbert Baker Elementary School, situated in Edmonton, AB, Canada.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>17 April 2020 - selected by <em>Dr Sage Evergreen</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5199">SCP-5199</a> (I Always Loved You, Dear, and I Always Will.) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/notochordian" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4940522&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="Notochordian" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4940522)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/notochordian" >Notochordian</a></span></li> <li><em>Both components of SCP-5199 were brought into containment on May 5th, 2019, shortly after the surgical removal of SCP-5199-A.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>25 April 2020 - selected by <em>Sonderance</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4645">SCP-4645</a> (Blackmailing Computer) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5045819&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="Calibri Bold" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5045819)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" >Calibri Bold</a></span></li> <li><em>SCP-4645 is also capable of targeting individuals with threats; however, its influence has not been seen to extend beyond Site-15.</em></li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <p>~</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">2020&nbsp;REVIEWERS’&nbsp;SPOTLIGHT&nbsp;MAY&nbsp;-&nbsp;AUGUST</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">2020&nbsp;REVIEWERS’&nbsp;SPOTLIGHT&nbsp;MAY&nbsp;-&nbsp;AUGUST&nbsp;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <h4><span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">May 2020:</span></span></h4> <p><strong>1 May 2020 - selected by <em>Calibri Bold</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4456">SCP-4456-D</a> (No One Expects The Spanish Decommission!) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5045819&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="Calibri Bold" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5045819)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" >Calibri Bold</a></span></li> <li><em>After every reproduction incident, the new SCP-4456 instance is to be provided with 2,500 pounds of pure silver.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>9 May 2020 - selected by <em>Nagiros</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4310">SCP-4310</a> (The Hero's Journey) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1841781&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="A Random Day" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1841781)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" >A Random Day</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3938622&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="The Great Hippo" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3938622)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo" >The Great Hippo</a></span></li> <li><em>SCP-4310 is an anomalous species of centipede.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>17 May 2020 - selected by <em>cybersqyd</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-eschaton">Serpent Bound \\\ BEAR WITNESS</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nagiros" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4665703&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="Nagiros" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4665703)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nagiros" >Nagiros</a></span></li> <li><em>The Eschaton is self-evident.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>25 May 2020 - selected by <em>RockTeethMothEyes</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3520">SCP-3520</a> (Fourteen Orangutans) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lordstonefish" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2527320&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="LordStonefish" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2527320)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lordstonefish" >LordStonefish</a></span></li> <li><em>Despite apparent ease of containment, reclassification to Keter is under possible consideration.</em></li> </ul> <h4><span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">June 2020:</span></span></h4> <p><strong>1 June 2020 - selected by <em>sirpudding</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-2656">SCP-2656</a> (The Idiot Box) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cupertinoeffect" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1560371&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="CupertinoEffect" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1560371)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cupertinoeffect" >CupertinoEffect</a></span></li> <li><em>Stage 4: Sections of the brain are further dissected.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>9 June 2020 - selected by <em>DianaBerry</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5553">SCP-5553</a> (Psycho Social Media) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/citytoast" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1372124&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="CityToast" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1372124)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/citytoast" >CityToast</a></span></li> <li><em>Premature shutdown of the device does not mitigate the lethal effect of the infohazard.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>17 June 2020 - selected by <em>Naveil</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5909">SCP-5909</a> (The Endless Shrimp) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drakimoto" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5255688&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="DrAkimoto" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5255688)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drakimoto" >DrAkimoto</a></span></li> <li><em>SCP-5909 is a crustacean measuring an estimated 2.1 light-years in length, located 7.5 light-years from the Sol System.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>25 June 2020 - selected by <em>Zoobeeny</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-seed-of-an-idea">The Seed of an Idea</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thedeadlymoose" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=732274&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="thedeadlymoose" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=732274)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thedeadlymoose" >thedeadlymoose</a></span></li> <li><em>&quot;Not Pandora's Box,&quot; Suit said. &quot;Let's call it what it is.&quot;</em></li> </ul> <h4><span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">July 2020:</span></span></h4> <p><strong>1 July 2020 - selected by <em>OCuin</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3385">SCP-3385</a> (The Last Voyage of the <em>Far Horizon</em>.) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/malycegraves" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4916887&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="MalyceGraves" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4916887)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/malycegraves" >MalyceGraves</a></span></li> <li><em>SCP-3385 is a retrofitted</em> Vanguard<em>-class nuclear powered submersible vehicle.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>1 July 2020 - selected by <em>caspian2</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5440">SCP-5440</a> (Hotline Moses) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drakimoto" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5255688&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="DrAkimoto" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5255688)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drakimoto" >DrAkimoto</a></span></li> <li><em>SCP-5440 caused the bush to spontaneously combust and remain burning for approximately two and a half hours.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>17 July 2020 - selected by <em>Captain Cold</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5545">SCP-5545</a> (𝙰 𝙱 𝙽 𝙾 𝚁 𝙼 𝙰 𝙻 𝙸 𝚃 𝚈) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yossipossi" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2199269&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="Yossipossi" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2199269)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yossipossi" >Yossipossi</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5045819&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="Calibri Bold" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5045819)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" >Calibri Bold</a></span></li> <li><em>Conceptual Site-344-2 contains SCP-5545-2 via association lock.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>17 July 2020 - selected by <em>REDESERT</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5898">SCP-5898</a> (Corn Belt) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/its-a-bad-idea" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3181609&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="Its a Bad Idea" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3181609)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/its-a-bad-idea" >Its a Bad Idea</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ohnonium" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6050049&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="Ohnonium" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6050049)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ohnonium" >Ohnonium</a></span></li> <li><em><strong>Update 13/01/2020:</strong> Under no circumstances should Barn-002 be left unattended.</em></li> </ul> <h4><span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">August 2020:</span></span></h4> <p><strong>1 August 2020 - selected by <em>Riemann</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-3393-ex">SCP-3393-EX</a> (Girlfriend) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/captain-kirby" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3440103&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="Captain Kirby" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3440103)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/captain-kirby" >Captain Kirby</a></span></li> <li><em>Dr. Rivera is unable to retain knowledge regarding Dr. Verity or perceive him when directly confronted.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>9 August 2020 - selected by <em>forbiddenquest</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/mission-accomplished">Mission Accomplished</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/weizhong" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1777811&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="weizhong" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1777811)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/weizhong" >weizhong</a></span></li> <li><em>Well. No other way around it, he supposed.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>17 August 2020 - selected by <em>Sonderance</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5785">SCP-5785</a> (Craptivism) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/deadly-bread" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3988532&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="Deadly Bread" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3988532)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/deadly-bread" >Deadly Bread</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sonderance" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6091992&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="Sonderance" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6091992)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sonderance" >Sonderance</a></span></li> <li><em>SCP-5785 is capable of manifesting two connected portals of equal size with the sole limitation that one portal must be located within its body.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>25 August 2020 - selected by <em>cybersqyd</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/project-proposal-1994-103">Project Proposal 1994-103: &quot;A Song of Hope and Home&quot;</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3075960&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="stormbreath" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3075960)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormbreath" >stormbreath</a></span></li> <li><em>A listener that listens to the entirety of the song will experience a vision of my journey to the most beautiful thing that I have ever seen.</em></li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <p>~</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">2020&nbsp;REVIEWERS’&nbsp;SPOTLIGHT&nbsp;SEPTEMBER&nbsp;-&nbsp;DECEMBER</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">2020&nbsp;REVIEWERS’&nbsp;SPOTLIGHT&nbsp;SEPTEMBER&nbsp;-&nbsp;DECEMBER&nbsp;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <h4><span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">September 2020:</span></span></h4> <p><strong>1 September 2020 - selected by <em>KaraKatt</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5380">SCP-5380</a> (My World) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chiifu" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6394107&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="chiifu" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6394107)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chiifu" >chiifu</a></span></li> <li><em>I hope you'll live a good life. I'm sorry I couldn't be with you more.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>9 September 2020 - selected by <em>REDESERT</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5595">SCP-5595</a> (Geoffrey Quincy Harrison the Third: Site-Director, Gumball Machine) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaguepjp" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5813664&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="PlaguePJP" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5813664)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaguepjp" >PlaguePJP</a></span></li> <li><em>PLEASE BRING ME TO MY OFFICE. DR. CROIX IS HOSTING A MUTINY.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>17 September 2020 - selected by <em>Naveil</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/i-just-wanna-survive">I Don't Wanna Be Special (I Just Wanna Survive)</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/oboebandgeek99" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1782920&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="Oboebandgeek99" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1782920)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/oboebandgeek99" >Oboebandgeek99</a></span></li> <li><em>It's Eric, by the way, in case you've forgotten. My therapist is making me do this.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>25 September 2020 - selected by <em>Francis Scalia</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5335">SCP-5335</a> (The Freudian Split) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/malycegraves" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4916887&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="MalyceGraves" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4916887)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/malycegraves" >MalyceGraves</a></span></li> <li><em>SCP-5335 was originally a highly decorated Special Agent with the FBI: Unusual Incidents Unit.</em></li> </ul> <h4><span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">October 2020:</span></span></h4> <p><strong>1 October 2020 - selected by <em>Cerastes</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5462">SCP-5462</a> (Misery is the State of Every Soul Burdened by Mortality.) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cerastes" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3352053&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="Cerastes" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3352053)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cerastes" >Cerastes</a></span></li> <li><em>[…] commonly referred to as his Black Paintings due to their emotionally disturbing contents, themes, and use of dark colours.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>9 October 2020 - selected by <em>Grigori Karpin</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5456">SCP-5456</a> (Sweatmother) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/faminepulse" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4275444&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="faminepulse" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4275444)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/faminepulse" >faminepulse</a></span></li> <li><em>“We can be human, yeah we can be respectful, but we can't tolerate chaos. You</em> have <em>to be our<sup>[sic]</sup> own dads.”</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>17 October 2020 - selected by <em>Sonderance</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4423">SCP-4423</a> (StepDemon) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dyslexion" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5549954&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="Dyslexion" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5549954)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dyslexion" >Dyslexion</a></span></li> <li><em>SCP-4423 is a Tartarean-Class demonic entity that manifests during sleep paralysis.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>25 October 2020 - selected by <em>OCuin</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5788">SCP-5788</a> (Partners in sync) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/riemann" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1787775&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="Riemann" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1787775)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/riemann" >Riemann</a></span></li> <li><em>The integration of SCP-5788 into the plumbing of the kitchen makes removal and characterisation difficult.</em></li> </ul> <h4><span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">November 2020:</span></span></h4> <p><strong>1 November 2020 - selected by <em>cybersqyd</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/they-call-him-he-who-cannot-see-his-reflection">To The Dreams He Is No Nobody</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/soullesssingularity" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=637830&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="SoullessSingularity" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=637830)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/soullesssingularity" >SoullessSingularity</a></span></li> <li><em>Suffice to say, Nobody and the dreams have something that humans may identify as a friendship.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>9 November 2020 - selected by <em>Dr Moned</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/catching-up">Catching Up</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/grigori-karpin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4558017&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="Grigori Karpin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4558017)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/grigori-karpin" >Grigori Karpin</a></span></li> <li><em>“I know you and a group of MTF-Beta-777 went into an alternate reality. You ‘read’ a structure there and had what amounts to a psychotic break.”</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>17 November 2020 - selected by <em>Truc Linh</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/procedure-420-perinaldo">Procedure 420-Perinaldo</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/peppermint-legos" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5515758&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="peppermint_legos" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5515758)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/peppermint-legos" >peppermint_legos</a></span></li> <li><em>My grandpa dodged Vietnam with a bari sax.</em></li> </ul> <p><strong>25 November 2020 - selected by <em>caspian2</em></strong></p> <ul> <li>Featured page: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5610">SCP-5610</a> (To Put a Cat on Your Head) by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/veralta" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6030962&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="Veralta" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6030962)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/veralta" >Veralta</a></span></li> <li><em>Approximately 56 percent of Japan's population has been found to have an instance of SCP-5610 resting atop of their head.</em></li> </ul> <h4><span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">December 2020:</span></span></h4> <p>No Reviewers' Spotlight features this month due to contest prize feature schedule. Happy Holidays!</p> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1404533&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609038819" alt="Zyn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1404533)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" >Zyn</a></span></p> 
